<title>USA: Harken begins Estero No. 1 drilling.</title>
<headline>Harken begins Estero No. 1 drilling.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harken Energy Corp said Friday drilling operations have begun on the Estero No. 1 well on what has been identified as the Palo Blanco Prospect in Colombia.</p>
<p>The Estero No. 1 well is expected to reach a depth of approximately 9,100 feet and should test five oil-prone zones prevalent in the Llanos Basin: the Carbonera, Mirador, Guadalupe, Gacheta and Ubaque formations.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
